  "freeze_protocol": [
    "Implement every planned member in M2_P4 without scientific execution.",
    "Run atomic QA over the assembled package and all negative fixtures.",
    "Require every positive invariant PASS and every negative fixture rejected.",
    "Record exact Git blobs and schema identifiers in a P5 QA artifact.",
    "Freeze the exact package only after P5 PASS.",
    "Perform M2_P6 zero-science governance adjudication against the frozen package.",
